     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi everyone,</div><div><br></div><div>The soilgrids option for the microclimate models stopped working a few days ago. The old version of soilgrids is now defunct and there is a new one available. I&#39;ve just updated the micro_ functions on github accordingly, and I&#39;ll do a new release with binaries soonish. Below I&#39;ve pasted the very helpful reply I got from Jorge Mendes on the soilgrids update.</div><div><br></div><div>All the best,<br>Mike<br></div><div><br></div><div>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br></div><div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>We\r\nhave a new version of soilgrids, you can read about it :</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><a href=\"https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/BN_IC0YZJpCGgRwnzswGmor?domain=isric.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/BN_IC0YZJpCGgRwnzswGmor?domain%3Disric.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240331152000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3sP0kX09vLcqzIfJE7hfNi\">https://www.isric.org/news/new-edition-soil-property-estimates-world-associated-web-platform-released-soilgrids250m</a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><a href=\"https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/hb63CgZolKFAwLZvJsou5uE?domain=isric.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/hb63CgZolKFAwLZvJsou5uE?domain%3Disric.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240331152000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0EPMVeK9YmaA-9ZWGqlst_\">https://www.isric.org/explore/soilgrids</a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>FAQ:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><a href=\"https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/9ljaCjZroMFnG7Qz0i5Ua1H?domain=isric.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/9ljaCjZroMFnG7Qz0i5Ua1H?domain%3Disric.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240331152000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1usG750nhBOqIT2p3Eyl80\">https://www.isric.org/explore/soilgrids/faq-soilgrids</a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Please\r\nconsult the FAQ and check the property names, description and units.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>The\r\nprevious REST that was using soilgrids data v1.0 (2017-03-10)  has been\r\ndiscontinued, you can read about it on the ISRIC news: </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><a href=\"https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/SK0gCk8vpKsOXMzDvc9HMka?domain=isric.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/SK0gCk8vpKsOXMzDvc9HMka?domain%3Disric.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240331152000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2CxtYm6xiUAzX-jyNB0qUa\">https://www.isric.org/news/discontinuation-soilgrids-2017-services</a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><a href=\"https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/Cn1HClxwqLc2PBNWlh1xQ3t?domain=isric.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/Cn1HClxwqLc2PBNWlh1xQ3t?domain%3Disric.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240331152000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2jfE-YElXEPEEHH3vwbuNs\">https://www.isric.org/news/soilgrids-version-2017-services-communication</a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>The\r\nsoilgrids data for that version is only available as webdav:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><a href=\"https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/QuK6CmOxr6sjPmNVqTDMpQL?domain=files.isric.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/QuK6CmOxr6sjPmNVqTDMpQL?domain%3Dfiles.isric.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240331152000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JHpAUB0mtDKZUFBmnuKKi\">https://files.isric.org/soilgrids/former/2017-03-10/</a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>We\r\nhave a new REST that is still beta, the openapi definitions can be found here:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><a href=\"https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/luaDCnxyvXc73JN4VIpuONX?domain=rest.isric.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/luaDCnxyvXc73JN4VIpuONX?domain%3Drest.isric.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240331152000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3wgy9MKhNkE1RmtKjb5sOD\">http://rest.isric.org/soilgrids/v2.0/docs</a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>New\r\nrest has a different url, request and response structure, and new variable\r\nnames (check the FAQ)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>In\r\nyou case give it a try using the new url</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><a href=\"https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/j7UVCoVzwKhrP73Amc7Lj_U?domain=rest.soilgrids.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://protect-au.mimecast.com/s/j7UVCoVzwKhrP73Amc7Lj_U?domain%3Drest.soilgrids.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240331152000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0wqLiHXmBSF7p3I2Bjjnzj\">https://rest.soilgrids.org/soilgrids/v2.0/properties/query?lon=140&amp;lat=-35&amp;property=bdod&amp;property=silt&amp;property=clay</a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Thank\r\nyou</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Jorge\r\nS. Mendes de Jesus</span></p>\r\n\r\n </div></div>"
